Because the application is served to your browser, you necessarily receive a
copy of it. Receiving that copy is not permission to redistribute it.


5. YOUR DATA

The application runs in your browser. Course outlines you upload are read on
your device and the file is never uploaded. Your schedule is stored only in
your own browser's local storage.

One exception, stated plainly: when you ask the application to read an outline,
the extracted text of that outline is sent to Anthropic's Claude to be turned
into structured dates, and that processing is governed by Anthropic's terms
rather than this licence. Nothing else leaves the page.


